OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet morning with rain turning
OL,6,Fheavy at times. A drier afternoon with
OL,7,Fpatchy drizzle and feeling very mild.
OL,8,FStrong southerly winds with gales
OL,9,Flater along the Down coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will be further spells
OL,12,Fof heavy rain spreading in from the
OL,13,Fsouthwest. Southerly winds will remain
OL,14,Fstrong with gale affecting the Irish
OL,15,FSea coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA mixture of bright spells
OL,18,Fand blustery showers, some heavy. A
OL,19,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales
OL,20,Fand feeling cooler than Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
